{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useIsFetching"},{"type":"text","value":" is an optional hook that returns the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":" of the queries that your application is loading or fetching in the background (useful for app-wide loading indicators)."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useIsFetching } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n// How many queries are fetching?\nconst isFetching = useIsFetching()\n// How many queries matching the posts prefix are fetching?\nconst isFetchingPosts = useIsFetching({ queryKey: ['posts'] })","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filters?: QueryFilters"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"link","href":"../../../../framework/react/guides/filters#query-filters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Query Filters"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"context?: React.Context<QueryClient | undefined>"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Use this to use a custom React Query context. Otherwise, "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"defaultContext"},{"type":"text","value":" will be used."}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isFetching: number"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Will be the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":" of the queries that your application is currently loading or fetching in the background."}]}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n`useIsFetching` is an optional hook that returns the `number` of the queries that your application is loading or fetching in the background (useful for app-wide loading indicators).\n\n```tsx\nimport { useIsFetching } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n// How many queries are fetching?\nconst isFetching = useIsFetching()\n// How many queries matching the posts prefix are fetching?\nconst isFetchingPosts = useIsFetching({ queryKey: ['posts'] })\n```\n\n**Options**\n\n- `filters?: QueryFilters`: [Query Filters](../../../../framework/react/guides/filters#query-filters)\n- `context?: React.Context<QueryClient | undefined>`\n  - Use this to use a custom React Query context. Otherwise, `defaultContext` will be used.\n\n**Returns**\n\n- `isFetching: number`\n  - Will be the `number` of the queries that your application is currently loading or fetching in the background.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useIsFetching\ntitle: useIsFetching\n---\n\n`useIsFetching` is an optional hook that returns the `number` of the queries that your application is loading or fetching in the background (useful for app-wide loading indicators).\n\n```tsx\nimport { useIsFetching } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n// How many queries are fetching?\nconst isFetching = useIsFetching()\n// How many queries matching the posts prefix are fetching?\nconst isFetchingPosts = useIsFetching({ queryKey: ['posts'] })\n```\n\n**Options**\n\n- `filters?: QueryFilters`: [Query Filters](../../../../framework/react/guides/filters#query-filters)\n- `context?: React.Context<QueryClient | undefined>`\n  - Use this to use a custom React Query context. Otherwise, `defaultContext` will be used.\n\n**Returns**\n\n- `isFetching: number`\n  - Will be the `number` of the queries that your application is currently loading or fetching in the background.\n"}
